"Find junk on this Mac that's safe to remove. Nothing is deleted until you choose to." = "找出這台 Mac 上可以放心刪除的垃圾。在你確認之前，不會刪除任何東西。";
"Scan" = "掃描";
"Scan Again" = "重新掃描";
"About Sweeply" = "關於 Sweeply";
"Language" = "語言";
"Follow System" = "跟隨系統";
"Scan to see how much space you can free up." = "掃描一下，看看能騰出多少空間。";
"Only this Mac's own disk is scanned. External drives are never touched." = "只掃描這台 Mac 自己的磁碟，絕不碰外接硬碟。";
"Developer tools" = "開發工具";
"App caches & logs" = "App 快取和日誌";
"Xcode build data" = "Xcode 編譯資料";
"Intermediate files from building projects (DerivedData). Xcode recreates them on the next build." = "編譯專案時產生的中間檔案（DerivedData）。下次編譯時 Xcode 會重新產生。";
"Xcode caches" = "Xcode 快取";
"Caches Xcode keeps for documentation, previews and other features. Recreated when needed." = "Xcode 為文件、預覽等功能保存的快取，需要時會重新產生。";
"Device support files" = "裝置支援檔案";
"Debug symbols copied from iPhones, Apple Watches and other devices you've connected to Xcode. Copied again the next time you connect that device." = "從連接過 Xcode 的 iPhone、Apple Watch 等裝置上拷貝的除錯符號。下次連接那台裝置時會重新拷貝。";
"Xcode archives" = "Xcode 封存";
"Builds you archived for distribution, including the symbols needed to read their crash reports. Only remove the ones you no longer need." = "你為發佈而封存的建置，包含解讀當機報告所需的符號。只刪除不再需要的。";
"Simulator caches" = "模擬器快取";
"Caches used by the iOS Simulator. Recreated when needed." = "iOS 模擬器使用的快取，需要時會重新產生。";
"Gradle caches" = "Gradle 快取";
"Dependencies and build caches downloaded by Gradle (Android Studio). Downloaded again when needed. Quit Android Studio before cleaning." = "Gradle（Android Studio）下載的相依套件和編譯快取，需要時會重新下載。清理前請先結束 Android Studio。";
"Homebrew downloads" = "Homebrew 下載檔案";
"Installer files Homebrew downloaded. Your installed packages are not affected." = "Homebrew 下載的安裝檔。不影響已安裝的套件。";
"Package manager caches" = "套件管理器快取";
"Download caches of pip, npm, Yarn, CocoaPods and Swift Package Manager. Downloaded again when needed." = "pip、npm、Yarn、CocoaPods 和 Swift Package Manager 的下載快取，需要時會重新下載。";
"App caches" = "App 快取";
"Temporary files apps keep to load faster. Apps recreate them as needed. Caches of apps that are running are skipped." = "App 為了加快載入而保存的暫存檔，需要時會重新產生。正在執行的 App 的快取會略過。";
"Logs" = "日誌";
"Log files written by apps. Only useful for troubleshooting." = "App 寫下的日誌檔，只在排查問題時有用。";
"Items: %lld" = "項目數：%lld";
"Skipped because the app is running: %lld" = "因 App 正在執行而略過：%lld";
"Nothing found" = "沒有找到";
"Show in Finder" = "在 Finder 中顯示";
"Not shown: %lld" = "未顯示：%lld";
"Selected: %@" = "已選：%@";
"Found: %@" = "共找到：%@";
"Cleaning isn't available yet — this version only scans." = "清理功能還沒完成，這一版只能掃描。";
"Move to Trash" = "移到垃圾桶";
"Version %@" = "版本 %@";
"Sweeply is free and open source (MIT License)." = "Sweeply 是免費的開源軟體（MIT 授權）。";
"Contact" = "聯絡方式";
"Source code on GitHub" = "GitHub 上的原始碼";
"If Sweeply saved you some space, you can buy the developer a coffee." = "如果 Sweeply 幫你騰出了空間，可以請開發者喝杯咖啡。";
"Support Sweeply" = "支持 Sweeply";
"Done" = "完成";
